      "message": "test: Adjust expected_swap for C++23\n\nstd::expected::value() must be able to throw std::bad_expected_access<E>\nif the expected contains an error. That requires copying the error type,\nwhich is not possible in this unit test that uses a non-copyable error\ntype.\n\nFix it by using the non-throwing value accessor.",
